## What to return
A JSON object carrying "body" and "commitments". Both are strings and nothing else is required.

To ground a claim, add a citation naming a block and quoting its own words, like this:
  "citations": [{"block": "09bf4dc676e6c7bd", "quote": "<words copied from that block>"}]

